          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಂತ್ಯಕ್ರಿಯೆ — antyakriye — \"a funeral\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಜ್ಜನ ಅಂತ್ಯಕ್ರಿಯೆಗೆ ಊರಿನ ಜನರೆಲ್ಲ ಬಂದರು. ajjana antyakriyege ūrina janarella bandaru. The whole village came to Grandfather's funeral."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಂತ್ಯ, the last, and ಕ್ರಿಯೆ, a rite: the last rites."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಂತ್ಯಕ್ರಿಯೆ (antyakriye) is borrowed from Sanskrit antyakriyā, \"the last rites, a funeral\", from antya \"last\" and kriyā \"an act, a rite\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
