              "text": "ಶ್ರದ್ಧಾಂಜಲಿ — śraddhāñjali — \"a tribute (to the dead)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಶಾಲೆಯ ಮಕ್ಕಳು ಸೈನಿಕರಿಗೆ ಶ್ರದ್ಧಾಂಜಲಿ ಅರ್ಪಿಸಿದರು. śāleya makkaḷu sainikarige śraddhāñjali arpisidaru. The school children paid tribute to the soldiers."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A tribute is offered to the dead, often with a minute of silence."
            }
          ]
        },
